.\" blkvue(1) manual page
.TH BLKVUE 1 "November 2025" "waffle8" "User Commands"
.
.SH NAME
blkvue \- print TC08 block contents from the PDP-8 monitor
.
.SH SYNOPSIS
Load the assembled binary (S\-record or tape) into core, then start execution at
.B 0064
.RI ( *0064
in source). Set block/unit before running.
.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B blkvue
is a PDP\-8 utility that reads one 256\-word block from the TC08 DECtape controller
and prints it as sixteen lines of octal words via the teleprinter (IOT 6041/6046).
Each line shows a 16\-word chunk with the line offset (0000, 0020, 0040, …, 0360).
.
.SS Configuration words
All configuration lives on page zero:
.TP
.B 0020 BLKNO
Block number to dump (octal).
.TP
.B 0021 UNITFL
Unit selector: leave zero for TC08 unit 0; set
.B 02000
to select unit 1 (read/write).
.TP
.B 0027 BUFAD
Buffer where the block is transferred (default
.B 02000
). The transfer uses TC08 DTXA/DTLB to DMA into this page.
.
.SS Flow
.IP "1." 3
DTCA resets the controller; DTXA loads the transfer address from
.BR BUFAD .
.IP "2."
DTLB starts the block transfer with the AC containing
.BR BLKNO " and " UNITFL .
If TC08 does not skip (error), blkvue prints "TC08 ERR" and halts.
.IP "3."
The buffer is printed: offset, colon, then 32 words per line, eight lines total.
.
.SS Teleprinter output
Characters are emitted with TSF/TLS (6041/6046). Ensure the simulator/host config
has a console device enabled so output is visible.
.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TC08_IMAGE0
Path to the read\-only unit0 tape image (controller default).
.TP
.B TC08_IMAGE1
Path to the read/write unit1 tape image (used when
.B UNITFL
sets unit 1).
.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Dump block 1 of unit0 (default):
.EX
*0020/ 00001         / set BLKNO
*0060                / start blkvue
.EE
.TP
Dump block 5 of unit1:
.EX
*0020/ 00005         / BLKNO
*0021/ 02000         / UNITFL selects unit 1
*0060                / start
.EE
.TP
Assemble and write an S\-record for loading:
.EX
tools/8asm pdp8/blkvue.pa blkvue.srec
.EE
.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B pdp8/blkvue.pa
Source code.
.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR 8asm (1),
.BR tc08 (1),
.BR pdp8 (1)
.
.SH AUTHOR
waffle8 contributors
